- Charles Dickens — opening material from David Copperfield: first‑person childhood memory voice (birth on a Friday night, caul anecdote, early domestic scenes with “Bea,” trips to Yarmouth, the carrier Barkis, early schooling). Rich in childhood detail and formative incidents.
